<td valign=3D"top"><span style=3D"font-size:24px;font-style:italic;font-fam=
ily:Georgia, serif;font-weight:400;line-height:140%;color:#0077B6">Jeff Rue=
ter</span></td>
<td width=3D"110" height=3D"90" style=3D"line-height:0;font-size:0"><img sr=
c=3D"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/uploads/2026/05/27/Jeff_Rueter,_L.png?quality=
=3D85&amp;dpr=3D2&amp;width=3D120&amp;s=3D4f8bd7f9e2822a68a46abedae51ba2b4"=
 alt=3D"Jeff Rueter" width=3D"110" height=3D"90"></td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style=3D"border-top:2px dashed;border-top-color:#999999;background-=
color:#FFFFFF;padding-bottom:8px">=C2=A0</td></tr>
<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Nailing the pronunciation of Gjivai Zechi=
=C3=ABl may be a challenge for some, but it=E2=80=99ll be worth the effort.=
 The Dutch G is a guttural one, not struck with a tongue so much as residin=
g under one=E2=80=99s uvula like a congested H: <em>kHEE-vye</em>. The surn=
ame is a bit more straightforward: <em>ZEH-kee-el</em>, a natural decrescen=
do of emphasis with every syllable.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Used in a sentence: Gjivai Zechi=C3=ABl is=
 one of the hottest midfielders in Europe, enjoying arguably the most rapid=
 emergence of any high-level player in 2026.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In few other industries would a 22-year-ol=
d be viewed as something of a late bloomer, but such is the nature of socce=
r at present. Zechi=C3=ABl left boyhood club Sparta Rotterdam for crosstown=
 rival Feyenoord=E2=80=99s academy at age 14, only earning a senior contrac=
t as he neared his 18th birthday =E2=80=93 a bit later than most of their a=
cademy prospects. For reference, Shaqueel van Persie signed his first senio=
r deal before turning 16.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Still not ready for the first team, Zechi=
=C3=ABl continued to develop with loans to fellow Eredivisie sides Sparta R=
otterdam and Utrecht. The latter stint was especially useful, giving him 50=
 appearances in all competitions to adjust to life as a first-choice starte=
r.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It=E2=80=99s status he=E2=80=99s relished =
in since returning to Feyenoord. Zechi=C3=ABl opened his Champions League a=
ccount in audacious style on Wednesday, giving the hosts an early equalizer=
.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Curiously for a player who=E2=80=99s hitti=
ng new heights with every performance, nobody seems to agree on how tall Ze=
chi=C3=ABl is. Some resources list him at 5ft 7in, while others insist he=
=E2=80=99s a flat six-footer. The eye test suggests he=E2=80=99s on the tal=
ler half of that spectrum, as his legs make him a tricky operator in conges=
ted areas. On the ball, he applies the crucial half-touch prods in tight qu=
arters to keep opponents from taking the ball off of his feet. In defense, =
his legs can gum up passing lanes in a hurry, much to Como=E2=80=99s frustr=
ation in the first half of their Champions League tie.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Fortunately, his performance data is more =
straightforward than his listed height. Zechi=C3=ABl has been a crucial fig=
ure in Feyenoord=E2=80=99s early push to the top of the Eredivisie, a start=
er in all eight league games as well as both Champions League fixtures. He=
=E2=80=99s logged a goal contribution in seven of his first 10 games now, i=
ncluding five goals and four assists in the league.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">His composure makes him a confident upfiel=
d dribbler, operating in the advanced right station of Feyenoord manager Gi=
ovanni Van Bronckhorst=E2=80=99s three-man midfield. His instinct is to set=
 up shop inside the final third, where he looks to play balls into the box =
or get into areas for late-arrival shots.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In the early Eredivisie season, per FotMob=
, Zechi=C3=ABl averages 2.54 chances created per 90 (92nd percentile league=
-wide for his position) while generating 0.33 expected assists per 90 (94th=
 percentile). He helps Feyenoord congest the opponent=E2=80=99s area, makin=
g 5.3 box touches per 90, and puts over half of his attempts on-frame (2.7 =
shots per 90, 1.5 shots on target per 90).</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Already a vital figure for a title contend=
er, <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEm=
Fuifc_XG18IR1BdYuuc-iCsEGbMZE4_j1cSkONL07vmEwuOxcLWYYnsWKBfR82I-rG5Dhdu274V=
fCf82ewSRYAM9WivZxLvlJYwjOX2jkA28qb-qj08PYujyG1ifL9N3OafIHrWxbmOxZ-FsfjYsph=
TGF698uszZR6YD6Dhibm8c_RTfmbuoQST4tYRWFw2iAYwPQtD893t1tor_CIXoTZrLa16aBOA0j=
DvYc3GZ7DThrronu8w9LkiNtWGYTyszlVcY_AZtWjOFirkwWOnzBqHOfdjlvw803kO0TAdcBhsP=
e7e1H6W3wjvEu44wHOgJo2i9oMT1h5d8g/4uw/CEI8IasVQhWW8oPXo0PzQQ/h7/h001.YbtmI4=
9wMVGJx6jiLGnARdQvhnzsiX7eAGkEiTsWw6M" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Feyenoord =
wisely extended his contract</a> in mid-September, securing his future thro=
ugh June 2029. =E2=80=9CI feel right at home here and know that I can still=
 make a lot of progress,=E2=80=9D Zechi=C3=ABl said in the club=E2=80=99s a=
nnouncement. =E2=80=9CNot just for me personally, but for the team as well.=
 We put a lot of energy into that every day. I can=E2=80=99t wait to see wh=
at=E2=80=99s still to come.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">And yet he=E2=80=99s already a growing pre=
sence in the transfer rumor mills, having been linked to over half of the P=
remier League=E2=80=99s big six in recent weeks. His approach has also caug=
ht Xavi=E2=80=99s eye, with the new Netherlands national team coaching givi=
ng Zechi=C3=ABl his senior debut on 1 October against Greece.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Given the more open state of play in the E=
redivisie, teams in Europe=E2=80=99s largest leagues are often doubtful tha=
t a player=E2=80=99s output from that league will translate to their own; f=
or every success like Sunderland=E2=80=99s Brian Brobbey, there=E2=80=99s a=
 disappointment like Milan=E2=80=99s Santi Gim=C3=A9nez. Zechi=C3=ABl, thou=
gh, projects well due to how much of his game relies on his instincts and p=
hysicality =E2=80=93 traits that are applicable and appreciated in all comp=
etitions.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">He glides on the ball with ease through th=
e midfield, and regularly pops up in different areas at the edge of the box=
 to pose a threat. He=E2=80=99s almost constantly in motion off the ball, d=
rifting to close passing lanes and checking his spacing between his defense=
 and the forwards alike. His creativity is already padding Feyenoord=E2=80=
=99s scorelines, while his instincts are swiftly translating to the Champio=
ns League level.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It=E2=80=99s a rare delight when a player =
breaks out at a later stage than more-hyped teenagers such as Lamine Yamal =
and Cavan Sullivan. Time will tell how Zechi=C3=ABl=E2=80=99s progression w=
ill compare.</p>
