<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><em>In which the Guardian staff pick one g=
ame each day that we think is worth watching. Broadcast info is US and all =
times ET. Games for Monday to Wednesday will be covered in our Monday editi=
on.</em></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Thursday:</strong> While the Europ=
a League boasts a full slate, today=E2=80=99s nightcap includes the first l=
eg of the Copa Libertadores semifinal between Argentine side Estudiantes an=
d Brazilians Flamengo. Estudiantes will hope hosting the first leg bucks po=
or recent form, having lost three of their last five to slump to mid-table =
in the Argentinian first division. Flamengo are hoping to win a second inst=
allment in three years, currently atop Brazil=E2=80=99s S=C3=A9rie A and ar=
e unbeaten in their last nine. <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-st=
yle: normal; font-weight: 700;">Estudiantes v Flamengo</strong></em> is at =
8.30pm on beIN Sports.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Friday:</strong> A pair of recentl=
y relegated Premier League sides hope to snap their middling returns to the=
 Championship, with Burnley (21st) hosting Wolves (10th). Wolverhampton hav=
en=E2=80=99t won any of their last eight trips to Turf Moor, last there win=
ning in March 2010. Burnley will hope the ageless England duo of Kyle Walke=
r and Jamie Vardy can push them to the promotion playoff spots rather than =
a relegation scrap. <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: normal=
; font-weight: 700;">Burnley v Wolves</strong></em> is at 3pm on Paramount+=
.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Saturday:</strong> The Washington =
Spirit and Gotham FC have quickly become the NWSL=E2=80=99s marquee matchup=
, and are again occupying two of the top three places in the standings. The=
 Spirit will need to win at home to complicate Gotham=E2=80=99s quest for t=
he NWSL Shield =E2=80=93 not that they=E2=80=99re lacking for motivation, h=
aving lost to the New Jerseyan side in last year=E2=80=99s NWSL Championshi=
p final. Sam Kerr wasted no time in finding peak form after returning to th=
e NWSL, with four goals and four assists in her first 14 matches for Gotham=
. <em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700=
;">Spirit v Gotham</strong></em> is at 12.30pm on Paramount+.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Sunday:</strong> Usually, the =E2=
=80=9CHell Is Real=E2=80=9D derby sees its Ohioan combatants at the top of =
the Eastern Conference. Not so this season, as Cincinnati have slumped half=
 a decade into the Pat Noonan era while the Columbus Crew have struggled si=
nce Wilfried Nancy departed after 2025. Cincinnati host this edition and oc=
cupy the ninth and final playoff spot in the East, while Columbus sit 13th =
but are still just four points behind their cross-state rival. A unique ins=
tallment in one of MLS=E2=80=99s best rivalries, <em><strong style=3D"color=
: #0077B6; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700;">Cincinnati v Columbus Cre=
w</strong></em> is at 5pm on Apple TV.</p>
